Method
------
I attacked the Green r6 helpers (BLOCK_COMMENT_RE at
scripts/__tests__/oxc-toolchain-gates.test.ts:903, BLOCK_DISABLE_RE at :904,
TRAILING_DISABLE_RE at :905, stripDisableComments at :910, and
directiveKindsOfFile at :986) with seeded files in temp folders under
apps/, each with a paired control, and I compared three things for each
form: what oxlint honors (live probe with the root config), what the pin
counts, and what the strip removes. A 17-form probe script, three focused
re-probes, and a 49-carrier sweep replica produced the data.

